  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This small, handheld gadget emanates a constant field of protection around the user.</p>\n<p>While holding the gadget, you have a +1 bonus to AC.</p>\n<p>The gadget has 10 charges. With the gadget in hand, you can use your action to use: Gadget Armor (1 charge) or Shield (2 charges). No components required.</p>\n<p>The gadget regains 1d6 + 4 expended charges each day at dawn. If you expend the last charge, roll a d20. On a 1, the gadget becomes unsalvageable.</p>",
